cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite the paper below."
title: "PFAS aquatic criteria: support dependence of extreme-anchored derivation"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and derived data for a study of how aquatic water-quality
  criteria for PFAS depend on the amount of toxicity testing behind them, and
  what that dependence costs in a national surface-water monitoring record.
type: software
